# ============================================================
# Kiosk ML models
#
# The kiosk models ARE committed on purpose. The browser fetches
# /models/clip_vision_q8.onnx (+ uniform_prompts.json) at runtime, so if
# they are missing from the repo the deployed kiosk silently loses
# dress-code detection — it still matches faces, it just fails every
# uniform check with no obvious cause.
# ============================================================
*.pt
*.onnx
!services/kiosk/public/models/*.onnx
*.engine
*.zip
Uniform_left/

runs/
!services/kiosk/training/dataset/
!services/kiosk/training/runs/

# Training dataset — 43 MB of Roboflow images, needed only to RETRAIN, never to
# run or deploy. Re-download from the url in uniform/data.yaml. Delete these
# four lines if you want the raw images in the repo.
uniform/train/
uniform/valid/
uniform/test/

# ============================================================
# Misc
# ============================================================
nul

# PlatformIO build output (regenerated by `pio run`)
.pio/

# Scratch working directory for capstone figures/screenshots
.capwork/
